      <h1>How Bitcoin Privacy Works</h1>
      <p class="msc-learn-page__deck">Bitcoin privacy depends on how information flows across the public blockchain, wallet software, network connections, services, merchants, devices, and later spending behavior. Bitcoin is pseudonymous, not automatically anonymous, and no single tool removes every possible link.</p>
      <ul class="msc-learn-page-meta"><li>Security</li><li>Shallow</li><li>Guide</li><li>11 to 13 minutes</li><li>Reviewed 2026-07-17</li></ul>
      <p class="msc-learn-preview-note">Preview only. Publication records and confirmed URLs do not exist; all navigation remains inactive.</p>
